        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alfred Santell, David Fincher, Aaron Hoffman\n- Works: Beloved Rogues, The Curious Case of Benjamin Button\n- Roles: film director, film producer, writer\n- Places: San Francisco, California\n\nFacts:\n- Alfred Santell was born as Alfred Allen Santell on September 14, 1895 in San Francisco, California.\n- Alfred Santell, also known as Al Santell, was an American film director and film producer.\n- Beloved Rogues is a 1917 American silent comedy-drama film directed and written by Alfred Santell, with the storyline by Aaron Hoffman.\n- David Fincher was born as David Andrew Leo Fincher on August 28, 1962.\n- David Fincher is an American director and producer known for films, television series, and music videos.\n- The Curious Case of Benjamin Button is a 2008 American romantic fantasy drama film directed by David Fincher.",
